{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 38, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler a journey to the Land of the Rising Sun doth await thee! Attend now to this itinerary wrought in verse and plan thy passage well.\n\n**Day First Arrival in Tokyo a City of Gleam**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt arrive at Narita's gate\nA bustling port where modern wonders wait\nTo Shinjuku's heights thy chariot shall steer\nAnd find thy lodgings banish every fear.\nExplore the gardens serene a tranquil sight\nThen dine on sushi bathed in neon light.\n\n**Day Second Tokyo's Wonders Unfold**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple a sacred place\nWhere ancient spirits hold their hallowed grace\nThen wander Shibuya's crossing a human stream\nA vibrant spectacle a waking dream.\nHarajuku's fashions a colorful array\nWhere youth and style hold undisputed sway.\n\n**Day Third Hakone's Beauty a Mountain's Kiss**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone's verdant grace\nWhere Mount Fuji's peak doth find its place\nCruise Lake Ashi's waters calm and deep\nWhile volcanic fumes their silent vigil keep.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum art doth bloom\nA landscape painted banishing all gloom.\n\n**Day Fourth Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto swift thou'lt fly\nA city steeped in history reaching high\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion maze\nThrough countless torii paths thy spirit strays.\nGion's geishas a fleeting lovely view\nA whispered secret forever fresh and new.\n\n**Day Fifth Kyoto's Temples and Zen**\n\nKinkaku-ji's gold a dazzling sheen\nThe Golden Pavilion a wondrous scene\nRyoan-ji's garden stones a cryptic art\nA meditative space to calm the heart.\nNijo Castle's grandeur a shogun's might\nWhere history echoes in the fading light.\n\n**Day Sixth Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara's park where deer roam free and bold\nA sacred haven stories to be told\nTodai-ji's temple houses Buddha grand\nA testament to faith across the land.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns softly glow\nA path to blessings a gentle flow.\n\n**Day Seventh Osaka's Delights and Farewells**\n\nTo Osaka now a city full of cheer\nDotonbori's lights banish all fear\nTry takoyaki and okonomiyaki's treat\nA culinary journey truly sweet.\nThen homeward bound thy journey nears its close\nWith memories made a treasure that grows.\n\nGo forth and revel in this wondrous land\nA journey blessed by fate's own hand.\nFarewell good traveler until we meet once more\nIn realms of wonder forevermore.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -1.5393308401107788}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.009858490899205208}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.1960994303226471}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.6439223885536194}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.02404201775789261}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -1.8316121101379395}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.11306671053171158}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.0001658063702052459}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -7.748573807475623e-06}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁doth", "logprob": -1.070265293121338}, {"token": "▁await", "logprob": -1.014777660369873}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.34611812233924866}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -1.5731079578399658}, {"token": "▁Attend", "logprob": -0.30169323086738586}, {"token": "▁now", "logprob": -0.13845764100551605}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.03875645622611046}, {"token": "▁this", "logprob": -0.0020817292388528585}, {"token": "▁itinerary", "logprob": -0.04036935418844223}, {"token": "▁wrought", "logprob": -1.584054946899414}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.007642790675163269}, {"token": "▁verse", "logprob": -0.27037882804870605}, {"token": "▁and", "logprob": -1.958646297454834}, {"token": "▁plan", "logprob": -2.4994916915893555}, {"token": "▁thy", "logprob": -0.08232356607913971}, {"token": "▁passage", "l